<div>
    <h3>关于认真做好2021-2022学年第二学期本科教学检查工作的通知</h3>
   <div class="time"><span>发布时间：</span>2022-02-19 11:08:45<span>来源：</span>
    <span> 点击：</span><script>_showDynClicks("wbnews", 1482657449, 14042)</script></div>

    
    <div id="vsb_content"><div class="v_news_content">
<style><!--  /* Font Definitions */  @font-face {font-family:宋体; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"Cambria Math"; panose-1:2 4 5 3 5 4 6 3 2 4;} @font-face {font-family:等线;} @font-face {font-family:方正小标宋简体;} @font-face {font-family:仿宋_GB2312;} @font-face {font-family:"\@宋体"; panose-1:2 1 6 0 3 1 1 1 1 1;} @font-face {font-family:"\@方正小标宋简体";} @font-face {font-family:"\@等线";} @font-face {font-family:"\@仿宋_GB2312";}  /* Style Definitions */  p.MsoNormal, li.MsoNormal, div.MsoNormal {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoHeader, li.MsoHeader, div.MsoHeader {mso-style-link:"页眉 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:center; vsb_temp-mode:char; border:none; padding:0cm; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} p.MsoFooter, li.MsoFooter, div.MsoFooter {mso-style-link:"页脚 Char"; margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; vsb_temp-mode:char; font-size:9.0pt; font-family:等线;} a:link, span.MsoHyperlink {color:#0563C1; text-decoration:underline;} a:visited, span.MsoHyperlinkFollowed {color:#954F72; text-decoration:underline;} p {margin-right:0cm; margin-left:0cm; font-size:12.0pt; font-family:宋体;} p.MsoListParagraph, li.MsoListParagraph, div.MsoListParagraph {margin:0cm; margin-bottom:.0001pt; text-align:justify; text-justify:inter-ideograph; text-indent:21.0pt; font-size:10.5pt; font-family:等线;} span.Char {mso-style-name:"页眉 Char"; mso-style-link:页眉;} span.Char0 {mso-style-name:"页脚 Char"; mso-style-link:页脚;} span.1 {mso-style-name:未处理的提及1; color:#605E5C; background:#E1DFDD;}  /* Page Definitions */  @page Section1 {size:595.3pt 841.9pt; margin:72.0pt 90.0pt 72.0pt 90.0pt; vsb_temp:15.6pt;} div.Section1 {page:Section1;}  /* List Definitions */  ol {margin-bottom:0cm;} ul {margin-bottom:0cm;} --></style>
<div class="Section1" style="vsb_temp: 15.6pt;">
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 26pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">各教学单位：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">根据学校本科教学计划工作安排，<span lang="EN-US">2021-2022</span>学年第二学期第<span lang="EN-US">1-2</span>周（<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-3</span>月<span lang="EN-US">6</span>日，按照原课表<span lang="EN-US">3-4</span>周课程安排）实施线上教学，第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>周（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日）恢复正常教学秩序，按照相应课表实施。为保障本科教学工作平稳有序开展，严格本科教育教学过程管理，及时发现和改进教学中的问题，实现线上线下教学同质等效，学校将开展本科教学检查工作。现将有关事项通知如下：</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">一、检查内容</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学计划落实：教学任务落实、教师（含助教）到岗、开课状况及课程临时变更情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学准备情况：课程资源建设、师生对接、教学平台运用、教材选用（包括教案、讲义等）、实验室准备等情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">课堂秩序和规范：教师教学言行、学生到课、课堂管理等情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学模式和改革：教学方式、师生互动、教学效果、课程思政等情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学保障条件：线上教学期间重点检查线上教学指导体系建设、网络状况等，正常教学期间检查教室基础设施、教学设备、卫生状况等情况。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">二、检查形式</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学检查分为两个阶段集中进行。线上教学期间（<span lang="EN-US">1-2</span>周，<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-3</span>月<span lang="EN-US">6</span>日）<strong>每天开展线上教学巡查</strong>，第<span lang="EN-US">5</span>周（<span lang="EN-US">3</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日<span lang="EN-US">-25</span>日）进行线下教学集中检查。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学检查以各学院自查为主，学校集中检查和抽查为辅。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">本科生院组建学校教学检查组，对全校教学运行整体情况进行检查。学院成立以教学副院长为组长的教学督导工作组，组员由本科教学督导、骨干教师、管理人员组成，分组开展教学检查工作。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">三、检查要求</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学检查是学校严肃教学纪律，加强教风、学风建设的重要措施，学校领导将开展线上课程巡听和线下课堂听课，了解掌握一线教学动态。学院领导应充分重视，深入教学一线指导、参与教学检查工作。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">线上教学期间，学院应建立线上教学课程组，开展线上教学状态监控，摸清每门课程平台使用和线上课程资源建设情况，并加强线上教学指导。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">学院应组织开展领导干部、教学督导、同行教师等通过线上线下的形式进行听评课，推荐优秀教学课程。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><strong><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">四、注意事项</span></strong></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">1.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">为保障教学秩序，如有调停课等情况，必须向学院申请，经本科生院审批同意后执行。审批通过后应及时通知学生，并变更教务系统相关信息。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">学校已在“西电智课”平台同步教师教学任务课程，任课教师应于<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">20</span>日前完成至少一周课程的资源建设（上传讲义、<span lang="EN-US">PPT</span>、教材、参考资料等，特别是<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">21</span>日、<span lang="EN-US">22</span>日有课的教师）。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">3.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学检查中，如发现异常情况，应及时研判和处理，典型性问题的处理应予以报送，相互借鉴，以保证教学的正常运行。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">4.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">各学院应认真组织教学检查，用细致的工作保证本科教学工作的规范运行。学院应于<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">20</span>日前将“理论课程建课及直播平台统计表”报送本科生院，<span lang="EN-US">3</span>月<span lang="EN-US">11</span>日前报送“线上教学检查异常情况记录表”，<span lang="EN-US">4</span>月<span lang="EN-US">1</span>日前报送“线下教学检查异常情况记录表”和“<span lang="EN-US">2021-2022</span>学年第二学期开学教学检查工作总结”。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">5.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">学校将汇总学院检查情况和学校抽查结果，在全校通报。检查过程中如遇到特殊问题，请即刻与本科生院联系。</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">联系人：姜超华，</span><span lang="EN-US"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;"><a href="mailto:chjiang@xidian.edu.cn">chjiang@xidian.edu.cn</a></span></span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">附件：<span lang="EN-US">1.</span>理论课程建课及直播平台统计表（<span lang="EN-US">EXCEL</span>表，另行</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">发送）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 75pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2.</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">教学检查异常情况记录表</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 75pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">3.2021-2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">学年第二学期教学检查工作总结（模板）</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt; margin-right: 15pt; word-break: break-all;"><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">本科生院</span><span lang="EN-US" style="font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;&nbsp;</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: right; line-height: 25pt; text-indent: 30pt; margin-right: 15pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">2022</span><span style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">年<span lang="EN-US">2</span>月<span lang="EN-US">19</span>日</span></p>
 <p class="MsoNormal" style="text-align: left; line-height: 15pt;"><span lang="EN-US" style="font-family: 仿宋_GB2312; font-size: 15pt;">&nbsp;</span></p>
</div>
